 R←Test_StormGuard_002(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;counts;html;en
⍝ `[TRAP]StormCeiling`: with a ceiling of 2, only two crashes within an hour get the full
⍝ treatment, even when every one of them is a first occurrence.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆StormGuardParms'Test_StormGuard_002'(,⊂'StormCeiling = 2')
 →T.PassesIf 2≡parms.stormCeiling

 counts←html←⍬
 :For en :In 501 502 503
     html,←parms ∆ProvokeCrash en
     counts,←parms.stormCount
 :EndFor

 →T.PassesIf counts≡1 1 1                       ⍝ Three different signatures ...
 →T.PassesIf html≡1 2 2                         ⍝ ... but the third one is held back

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
